        "notes": [
          {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in Firefox and Thunderbird. The Mozilla Foundation's Security Advisory describes the following issue: Firefox could have incorrectly parsed a URL and rewritten it to the youtube.com domain when parsing the URL specified in an embed tag. This could have bypassed website security checks that restricted which domains users were allowed to embed.",
            "title": "Vulnerability description"
          },
          {
            "category": "summary",
            "text": "firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect parsing of URLs could have allowed embedding of youtube.com",
            "title": "Vulnerability summary"
